    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Fixed the settings save failure caused by a new UI running against an older resident host. The dialog now sends only the current/default keys that the host advertises. A newly added unsupported control stays visible but disabled and asks for a restart; it can no longer block every other setting from saving. A rendered old-host simulation rejected unknown keys, saved Searcher hold time successfully, and confirmed loadingTransitionMinimumSeconds was omitted. Current-host settings checks also pass.",
